六年，秦滅周。君王后卒。二十三年，秦置東郡。二十八年，王入朝秦，秦王政置酒咸陽。三十五年，秦滅韓。三十七年，秦滅趙。三十八年，燕使荊軻刺秦王，秦王覺，殺軻。明年，秦破燕，燕王亡走遼東。明年，秦滅魏，秦兵次於歴下。四十二年，秦滅楚。明年，虜代王嘉，滅燕王喜。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為、繼位及局部事件暫接；姜齊與田齊桓公、不同時段未名王及同字忌分開。孫子不先補孫臏，子守髙唐不補闕字，索隱短稱與代詞仍待核；未跨篇按同名接人。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p053","text":"十六年，秦滅周。君王后卒。二十三年，秦置東郡。二十八年，王入朝秦，秦王政置酒咸陽。三十五年，秦滅韓。三十七年，秦滅趙。三十八年，燕使荊軻刺秦王，秦王覺，殺軻。明年，秦破燕，燕王亡走遼東。明年，秦滅魏，秦兵次於歴下。四十二年，秦滅楚。明年，虜代王嘉，滅燕王喜。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"君王后","kind":"person","person_id":"f04_rc9_xqn_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"秦王政","kind":"person","person_id":"dxz_9j5_10h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"44u_z5w_09n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"dxz_9j5_10h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"dxz_9j5_10h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"軻","kind":"person","person_id":"44u_z5w_09n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"燕王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0120","start":120,"end":123,"surface":"代王嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"wjp_1iw_3qf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m053-0125","start":125,"end":128,"surface":"燕王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"foo_